==Event Information==
<!--Event Information based on references, https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pMrdm2lmLws and https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=79MM3S9KsG0-->
Celebrate {{Color|#FF0000|'''6 Years of The Battle Cats'''}}!!<br>
Thank you so much for all your support since 2014! We couldn't have done it without all of our amazing players!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Enjoy 6th Anniversary events from September 25th (11am) through October 12th (11am)'''}}!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・6th Anniversary BEST OF THE BEST Capsules!'''}}<br>
The most popular Cat heroes join forces for this special Uber set along with {{Color|#FF0000|'''Li'l Valkyrie'''}}. and {{Color|#008000|'''Good-Luck Ebisu'''}}, only available during this event.<br>
Visit the {{Color|#008000|'''Rare Capsule Machine'''}} at the Cat Base for a chance to collect a cool ally from the {{Color|#008000|'''Best of the Best'''}} set!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''September 25th (11:00am) through 28th, 2020 (11:00am)!'''}}

This set includes awesome Cats like...<br>
・[[Togeluga (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Togeluga (Uber Rare)'''}}]] from Tales of the Nekoluga<br>
・[[Lasvoss (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''Lasvoss (Uber Rare)'''}}]] from The Dynamites<br>
・[[Date Masamune (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Date Masamune (Uber Rare)'''}}]] from Sengoku Wargods: Vajiras<br>
・[[Relentless Gladios (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#9900FF|'''Gladios (Uber Rare)'''}}]] from Dragon Emperors<br>
・[[Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Kalisa (Uber Rare)'''}}]] from Cyber Academy: Galaxy Gals<br>
・[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare)'''}}]] from Ancient Heroes: Ultra Souls<br>
・[[Detective Vigler (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Detective Vigler (Uber Rare)'''}}]] from Dark Heroes<br>
・[[Hades the Punisher (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Hades the Punisher (Uber Rare)'''}}]] from The Almighties<br>
・[[Mighty Kat-A-Pult (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Mighty Kat-a-pult (Uber Rare)'''}}]] from Iron Legion<br>
・[[Bora (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''Bora (Uber Rare)'''}}]] from Elemental Pixies<br>
・[[Wolfchild Deale (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#9900FF|'''Wolfchild Deale (Uber Rare)'''}}]] from Girls & Monsters<br>
Plus,<br>
・[[Li'l Valkyrie (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Li'l Valkyrie'''}}]] an {{Color|#FF0000|'''Uber Rare'''}} hero only available in this Best of the Best set with an English version-only look for her evolved form!<br>
・[[Good-Luck Ebisu (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''Good-Luck Ebisu (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
<small><small>※ The Uber Rare units listed above will have a set chance to appear from Rare Capsule draws during this event. Rare and Super Rare units may also be received during this event.<br>
※If the Best of the Best capsule set option does not appear in your app during the time listed above, please update your The Battle Cats app to the most recent version.<br>
※ The units above are not guaranteed to drop as a result of a capsule draw from this set. Standard Rare and Super Rare units may also be received from draws made during this event.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Super Limited Unit: "Gacha Cat" ON SALE!'''}}<br>
Between {{Color|#FF00CC|'''September 25th (aam) and October 12th (11am)'''}}, limited unit [[Gacha Cat (Special Cat)|Gacha Cat]] is available for direct purchase in a super value pack including Cat Food and XP!<br>
<small><small>※ Gacha Cat Set can only be purchased once per account during the sale period.<br>
※If the Best of the Best capsule set option does not appear in your app during the time listed above, please update your The Battle Cats app to the most recent version.<br>
※ If the Gacha Cat Sale fails to appear as scheduled, update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● First Time Draw Discount Restart!'''}}<br>
All players get a half-off discount on the Cat Food cost of their Rare Capsule draw following this discount reset! Your first {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Single Draw'''}} (normally 150 Cat Food) will cost only {{Color|#FF00CC|'''30 Cat Food!'''}}<br>
And your first {{Color|#FF00CC|'''11-Capsule Draw'''}} (normally 1500 Cat Food) will cost you only {{Color|#FF00CC|'''750 Cat Food!'''}}<br>
<small><small>※ If the First Time discount fails to appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.<br>
※Please be aware that received characters are randomly chosen; Uber Rares are not guaranteed during this event.<br>
※One single draw and one 11-draw may be made at the discounted Cat Food cost above. Cat Food costs will return to normal following these draws.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Catclaw Dojo Challenges'''}}<br>
Get your strongest soldiers of the Cat Army ready, the Dojo Ranking Event is here throughout the 6th Anniversary Campaign and it's time to prove yourself!<br>
Head to the Catclaw Dojo from the Battle Cats Title Menu and enter the Arena of Honor to join in the challenge! Climb to the highest tiers of power as your scores are measured against all other Battle Cats players? Can you make it to the top 10%?<br>
Try as many times as you like before the event ends, and earn a special prize when your final high score determines your skill tier on October 12th! Tap the Rewards List button to see what you might win as you climb the rankings!<br>
Plus, collect bonus rewards for completing the dojo mission at the Catnip Challenges!<br>
<small><small>※ 6th Anniversary dojo mission rewards can only be collected until the end of this campaign on October 12th (11am). If the collect button is not pressed for a completed mission before this deadline, the rewards will become unavailable.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Super Challenging Limited Special Stages appear in one big event!'''}}<br>
Can you topple the biggest bosses of the Special Stages?<br>
Irregularly appear Limited Special stages are coming one after the other between {{Color|#FF00CC|'''September 26th (11am) and October 3rd (11:59pm)'''}}<br>
Check the schedule below!

・{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Clionel Ascendant'''}}<br>
September 25th (11:00am) thru 26th (10:59am)<br>
・{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Deeply Dreaming'''}}<br>
September 26th (11:00am) thru 27th (10:59am)<br>
・{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Queen's Coronation'''}}<br>
September 27th (11:00am) thru 28th (10:59am)<br>
・{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Dead on Debut'''}}<br>
September 28th (11:00am) thru 29th (10:59am)<br>
・{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''King Wahwah's Revenge'''}}<br>
September 29th (11:00am) thru 30th (10:59am)<br>
・{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''River Styx'''}}<br>
September 30th (11:00am) thru 30st (10:59am)<br>
・{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Blue Impact'''}}<br>
October 1st (11:00am) thru 3rd (10:59am)

Can you withstand the gauntlet of giants?! Clear the stages and earn limited Cat Unit rewards!<br>
Plus, get extra rewards by clearing Special Missions in the Catnip Challenges!<br>
<small><small>※ All Mission Rewards must be claimed at the Catnip Challenges before this event ends on October 3rd (11:59pm).</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 6th Anniversary Special Stages!'''}}<br>
Clear the {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Birthday Present!'''}} map to earn a {{Color|#FF0000|'''20 Cat Food reward'''}} on your first clear each day between {{Color|#FF00CC|'''September 25th (11am) and October 12th, 2020 (11am)'''}}!<br>
The stage rewards will {{Color|#008000|'''reset once each day at 12:00am'''}}, so clear it again and again until the end of the event to pick up a daily Cat Food prize!<br>
If you clear the stage each and every day of this event, you can pick up a {{Color|#FF0000|'''max total of 360 Cat Food!'''}} If you include daily login stamp rewards, you can get a {{Color|#FF0000|'''total of 610 bonus Cat Food'''}} from this campaign!<br>
Plus, don't miss out on the Birthday Present mission in the Catclaw Challenges!<br>
<small><small>※ 6th Anniversary mission rewards can only be collected until the end of this campaign on October 12th (11am). If the collect button is not pressed for a completed mission before this deadline, the rewards will become unavailable..</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Cybear's Vengeance Returns!'''}}<br>
Your chance to collect a pile of Cat Tickets! The Deadly challenge "Cybear's Vengeance" is here for a limited time between {{Color|#FF00CC|'''September 25th (11am) and October 3rd (11:59pm), and again from October 4th (12:00am) through October 12th, 2020 (11am)'''}}!<br>
Clear the stage and you might pick up a stack of {{Color|#FF0000|'''5 Cat Tickets!'''}} (Available to collect one during each event period)

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Event All Stars map: Super Present DX!'''}}<br>
A limited addition to the Event All Stars series of special maps, available only for a limited time! Collect awesome item rewards on stage clear!<br>
Seasonal enemies stand in your way! Can you fight them off? Earn victory to pick up {{Color|#FF0000|'''super useful battle items!'''}}<br>
Between {{Color|#FF00CC|'''September 25th (11am) and October 12th, 2020 (11am),'''}} challenge this map at the times below:<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''6:00am~8:59am / 12:00pm~2:59pm / 7:00pm~10:59pm'''}}<br>
Plus, earn {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''30 Cat Food'''}} each time you clear an All-Stars stage for the first time!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● English Version Only Special Stages!'''}}<br>
Take on the limited edition stage {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Minced Meet-Up'''}}, and collect the English version-only unit [[Catburger (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Catburger'''}}]]!<br>
Then visit Stories of Legend/Event Stages during this event to take on the limited awakening stage {{Color|#FF0000|'''"Catburger Awakens!"'''}} for a chance to claim the power of {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catburger's third form'''}}!
<small><small>※ Upgrade Catburger to level 20 to reveal the Evolve option in the Upgrade screen!
※ If you have not collected Catburger, you can still collect its third form as a drop reward and use it once you meet the Evolve conditions.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Limited GAMATOTO Expedition Areas'''}}<br>
Only during this event, you can send your Gamatoto adventurer to the limited areas {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Cats Eye Cave'''}} and {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''XP Harvest'''}} for a special set of Cats Eye rewards!<br>
Get as many Cats Eyes as you can and help your units break through to even higher levels!<br>
Don't miss this special chance!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・Cats Eye Cave'''}}<br>
September 25th (11:00am) thru October 3rd (11:59pm)<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・XP Harvest (3 areas)'''}}<br>
October 4th (12:00am) thru October 12th (10:59am)

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Catfruit/Catseye Item Capsule Events!'''}}<br>
At the Capsule Menu, tap the buttons at top left to switch between standard Capsule events and the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catfruit Item Capsules'''}} & {{Color|#FF0000|'''Catseye Item Capsules'''}}!<br>
Power up your Cats! Don't miss out on these cool items!

{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・Catfruit Item Capsules'''}}<br>
September 25th (11am) thru October 3rd (11:59pm)<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''・Catseye Item Capsules'''}}<br>
October 4th (12:00am) thru October 12th (10:59am)<br>
<small><small>※The Catfruit Item Capsules provide Catfruit, XP and various battle item rewards, while Catseye Limited Capsules will provide Catseyes, XP and battle items!<br>
※Catfruit Limited Capsules will appear after Empire of Cats Ch. 3 is completed in The Battle Cats, and Catseye Limited Capsules will appear in the Cat Capsules once User Rank 1600 is cleared.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Daily Treasure Festivals!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF6D01|'''During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates'''}} in Story Mode chapters for a special {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Treasure Festival'''}}, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#008000|'''even days'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''odd days'''}} head to {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#0563C1|'''9/27, 9/30, 10/3, 10/6, 10/9, 10/12'''}}!<br>
<small><small>※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● 50% Off Cat Food Discount on Special Cats'''}}<br>
Pick up all the Special Cats at half the cost and expand your strategic potential!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Sale Period 1: September 25 (11:00) thru September 27, 2020 (11:00am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Sale Period 2: October 2 (11:00) thru October 4, 2020 (11:00am)'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Sale Period 3: October 9 (11:00) thru October 11, 2020 (11:00am)'''}}<br>
Complete your collection by taking advantage of this special offer!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app each day to collect a new login stamp and unlock awesome rewards of {{Color|#FF00CC|'''Cat Food, Rare Tickets'''}} and more during this anniversary campaign!<br>
Don't miss a day to pick up the maximum total rewards of {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''250 Cat Food'''}} and {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''5 Rare Tickets!'''}} Plus, collect limited special uniits [[Farmer Cat (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Farmer Cat'''}}]] with your {{Color|#FF0000|'''3rd stamp'''}}, and [[Coin Cat (Special Cat)|{{Color|#0563C1|'''Coin Cat'''}}]] with your {{Color|#0563C1|'''6th stamp!'''}}<br>
<small><small>※ After collecting Farmer Cat and Coin Cat, activate them at the Special Cats section of the Upgrade menu.</small></small>

